<div class="sq-testimonials">
<h2>What Students Are Saying...</h2>
<div class="sq-slides">
<div class="sq-slide first"><img alt="Headshot of Georgia Dixon, Communication Studies student" class="sq-image" src="student-testimonial/_images/student-bio-individual/Georgia Dixon.jpg"/>
<div class="sq-text">
<p class="sq-name">Georgia Dixon</p>
<p class="sq-degree">Associate of Science in Communication Studies</p>
<p class="sq-sm-text">When arriving at Columbia State as a lost 18-year-old, I was scared I would be alone in this journey. I’m so glad to say I couldn’t have been more wrong. The faculty helped me find my voice... <a href="student-testimonial/student-bio-pages/student-bio-georgia-dixon.html">Read more about Georgia</a></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sq-slide second"><img alt="Headshot of Jordan Johnson, Pre-Health Professions student" class="sq-image" src="student-testimonial/_images/student-bio-individual/Jordan Johnson .jpg"/>
<div class="sq-text">
<p class="sq-name">Jordan Johnson</p>
<p class="sq-degree">Associate of Science in Pre-Health Professions</p>
<p class="sq-sm-text">My experience at Columbia State helped me become more involved through SGA, where I learned how to support others, be a voice for students and serve my campus community. Those experiences strengthened my... <a href="student-testimonial/student-bio-pages/student-bio-jordan-johnson.html">Read more about Jordan</a></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sq-slide third"><img alt="Headshot of Montserrat Coronado, Marketing student" class="sq-image" src="student-testimonial/_images/student-bio-individual/Montserrat Coronado .jpg"/>
<div class="sq-text">
<p class="sq-name">Montserrat Coronado</p>
<p class="sq-degree">Associate of Science in Marketing</p>
<p class="sq-sm-text">The biggest impact on me during my time at Columbia State was the opportunity to get involved outside the classroom. Programs like PLS and campus events helped me build confidence and leadership skills... <a href="student-testimonial/student-bio-pages/student-bio-montserrat-coronado.html">Read more about Montserrat</a></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sq-slide fourth"><img alt="Headshot of Sarah Anye, Nursing student" class="sq-image" src="student-testimonial/_images/student-bio-individual/Sarah Anye .jpg"/>
<div class="sq-text">
<p class="sq-name">Sarah Anye</p>
<p class="sq-degree">Associate of Applied Science in Nursing</p>
<p class="sq-sm-text">Columbia State helped me develop skills to use in the workforce and prepared me for furthering my education. I met amazing teachers who encouraged me every step of the way to be my best version... <a href="student-testimonial/student-bio-pages/student-bio-sarah-anye.html">Read more about Sarah</a></p>
</div>
</div>
